            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're in the market for a new commercial trailer, you already know that not all trailers are built the same. Brand matters. Especially when you're investing in equipment that needs to work hard, last long, and deliver results without constant repair. That's why many Florida businesses and owner-operators choose to buy from a Globe Trailers dealership like <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With a reputation for American-made quality, long-term value, and heavy-duty performance, Globe Trailers is built for businesses that take hauling seriously. And when you work with a trusted dealership like ours, you get more than a trailer; you get a team ready to keep you moving. Here's what sets Globe Trailers apart from the rest.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-built-for-work",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built for Hard Work, Not Just Looks",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "built-for-work"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-built-for-work-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Globe Trailers are engineered to handle the toughest jobs. Whether you're moving heavy machinery, construction equipment, or oversized freight, Globe's lowboys, detachable goosenecks, and flatbeds are built with reinforced steel, precise welding, and premium components. That attention to structural detail means fewer repairs, better load security, and peace of mind every time you hit the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-made-in-florida",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Made in Florida, Proven Across the Country",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "made-in-florida"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-made-in-florida-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Globe Trailers are proudly manufactured in Bradenton, Florida. That local commitment means you get the benefit of trailers designed with Southeastern haulers in mind, while still meeting national demands for durability, load capacity, and road performance. Their trailers are not only DOT compliant but built to exceed industry expectations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-roi",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Long-Term ROI",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "roi"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When comparing trailer brands, it's easy to focus on price. But experienced haulers know it's the lifetime value that counts. Globe Trailers are designed to outlast competitors, reduce downtime, and retain resale value better than many other brands in the market.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-roi-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
                        "label": "Find the Right Trailer",
                        "style": "primary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Service That Matches the Quality of the Product",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "As an authorized Globe Trailers dealership, our service doesn't end after the sale. We offer:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-service-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "dot",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "In-house parts and repair support"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Preventive maintenance for Globe models"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Direct communication with the manufacturer for fast warranty help"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Technicians trained to understand Globe's unique build standards"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you buy from Sun State, you get a team that knows these trailers inside and out.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-service-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Local Expertise, Statewide Support",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With multiple locations across Florida, including Tampa, Sarasota, Davenport, and Brooksville, we support your business with convenience and consistency. Our local teams understand Florida roads, industries, and regulations, making us a smarter partner than big-box national dealers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-comparing-brands",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Comparing Brands: What to Look for When Buying New",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "comparing-brands"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-comparing-brands-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not sure how Globe stacks up? Here's what to keep in mind when comparing Globe to other trailer brands.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-comparing-brands-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "compare4",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Reinforced by design",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "BUILD MATERIALS",
                        "intro": "High-tensile strength steel, reinforced cross members, and fully welded seams on all trailers ensure long-term reliability."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "10-15+ years of service",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "LONGEVITY",
                        "intro": "Built for regular use with minimal structural issues. No need to worry about rust or wear."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Local, knowledgeable, fast",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "DEALER SUPPORT",
                        "intro": "Sun State Trailers works with Globe Trailers to provide fast access to parts, knowledgeable support, and local expertise."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Strong secondary demand",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "RESALE VALUE",
                        "intro": "Globe Trailers carry strong secondary market demand and are known for holding their value."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "marginBottom": 34
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-investing-in-quality-means",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Investing in Quality Means Less Downtime and More Profit",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-investing-in-quality-means-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you buy a trailer that breaks down, rusts early, or isn't spec'd right for your work, you lose time and money. Sun State Trailers helps prevent those problems by pairing Globe's best-in-class builds with our human-first approach. We ask the right questions up front. We listen. We don't just try to push you into the highest-priced trailer; we help you find the best trailer for your job.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-our-customers-say-it",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our Customers Say It Best",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-our-customers-say-it-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many of our longtime clients made the switch to Globe because they needed something better, and never looked back. From first-time buyers to seasoned operators, the feedback is the same: these trailers last, and the partnership with Sun State Trailers makes all the difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-ready-to-buy-a",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to Buy a Globe Trailer?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-buy-a-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're ready to upgrade to a trailer that works as hard as you do, we're ready to help. Browse our inventory of trailers, talk to a rep about your specs, or stop by your nearest <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> location. We're not just a trailer dealership. We're your long-term partner.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-ready-to-buy-a-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "contact-us",
                        "label": "Talk to a Sales Rep"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
